{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261020%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E6%B6%89%E9%9D%92%E6%B2%99%E5%85%AC%E8%B7%AF%E9%80%86%E7%B7%9A%E8%A1%8C%E9%A7%9B-30%E6%AD%B2%E7%A7%81%E5%AE%B6%E8%BB%8A%E5%8F%B8%E6%A9%9F%E8%A2%AB%E6%8E%A7%E5%8D%B1%E9%9A%AA%E9%A7%95%E9%A7%9B%E7%BD%AA-%E5%87%86%E4%BF%9D%E9%87%8B%E8%87%B312%E6%9C%8815%E6%97%A5%E5%86%8D%E8%A8%8A-916x1024.jpg\" width=\"916\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>一輛私家車本月12日涉於沙田青沙公路逆線行駛，涉案司機被控一項危險駕駛罪，案件今（20日）在沙田裁判法院首度提堂，被告暫毋須答辯，署理主任裁判官鄭紀航應辯方要求，將案件押後至12月15日再訊，以待索取文件及提供法律意見，被告獲准保釋外出。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>被告李文釗（30歲，報稱售貨員）被控於今年10月12日，在新界沙田青沙公路近里程標誌32.0S，在道路上危險駕駛一輛私家車。</p>\n<p>法院：沙田裁判法院<br/>法官：署理主任裁判官鄭紀航<br/>被告：李文釗<br/>控罪：危險駕駛<br/>案件編號：STCC3795/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:05.567975+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":271,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T08:24:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T19:37:36.668800+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684495+00:00","content_hash":"df215a9cd14a5e6ea1aafbf317d4fa89481730f2c681c647054b4b35d9479a19","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}